{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f3c2a10-5b7e-4c1d-9a2e-6d4f1b0c7e21",
    "name": "Mundialito API",
    "description": "Colección de la API del Mundialito de Fútbol Corporativo.\n\n**Uso:**\n1. Importar también el entorno `Mundialito - Local` y seleccionarlo (arriba a la derecha).\n2. Levantar el sistema con `docker compose up`.\n3. Ejecutar las carpetas en orden (o toda la colección con el Runner): cada request guarda en el entorno los Ids que usan los siguientes.\n\nCada ejecución crea equipos nuevos con nombres únicos, así que se puede correr varias veces.\n\n**Carpetas:** Equipos (CRUD completo), Jugadores, Partidos, Tabla y goleadores, Idempotencia y Errores (400 / 404 / 409).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Equipos",
      "description": "CRUD completo de equipos: GET (lista y por Id), POST idempotente, PUT (reemplazo), PATCH (parcial) y DELETE idempotente. Incluye filtros, paginación y ordenamiento.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar equipos (paginado)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Formato paginado { data, pageNumber, pageSize, totalRecords, totalPages }', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.keys('data', 'pageNumber', 'pageSize', 'totalRecords', 'totalPages');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.length).to.be.at.most(body.pageSize);",
                  "});",
                  "// El primer equipo del seed se usa como rival en los partidos.",
                  "if (body.data.length > 0) { pm.environment.set('rivalTeamId', body.data[0].id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/teams?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Filtrar por nombre y ordenar descendente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Todos los nombres contienen \"fc\"', () => {",
                  "  body.data.forEach(team => pm.expect(team.name.toLowerCase()).to.include('fc'));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Respeta el tamaño de página', () => pm.expect(body.data.length).to.be.at.most(5));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/teams?name=fc&sortBy=name&sortDirection=desc&pageNumber=1&pageSize=5"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear equipo (POST idempotente)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('teamName', 'Marketing FC ' + Date.now().toString().slice(-6));",
                  "pm.environment.set('teamKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve el header Location', () => pm.response.to.have.header('Location'));",
                  "const team = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve el equipo creado', () => pm.expect(team.name).to.eql(pm.environment.get('teamName')));",
                  "pm.environment.set('teamId', team.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{teamKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{teamName}}\",\n  \"coach\": \"Paula Ríos\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/teams"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener equipo por Id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Es el equipo pedido', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().id).to.eql(pm.environment.get('teamId')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reemplazar equipo (PUT)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Se reemplazó el entrenador', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().coach).to.eql('Andrea Salinas'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{teamName}}\",\n  \"coach\": \"Andrea Salinas\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Modificar solo el entrenador (PATCH)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const team = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Cambió solo el entrenador', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(team.coach).to.eql('Martín Ortega');",
                  "  pm.expect(team.name).to.eql(pm.environment.get('teamName'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"coach\": \"Martín Ortega\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear equipo temporal (para probar DELETE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('tempTeamName', 'Temporal FC ' + Date.now().toString().slice(-6));",
                  "pm.environment.set('tempTeamKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.environment.set('tempTeamId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{tempTeamKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{tempTeamName}}\",\n  \"coach\": \"Equipo de prueba\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/teams"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar equipo (DELETE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{tempTeamId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar de nuevo (DELETE idempotente)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('204 otra vez: el DELETE es idempotente', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{tempTeamId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Jugadores",
      "description": "Registro de jugadores por equipo, con filtros y paginación.",
